  "contract": "Doctor Theolen Krastinov (11261) throws Krastinov's Ghoulish Potion (92624) at a damage dealer: a ghoul transform and a charm for 10 s (tooltip: 'Ghoulified. Charmed for 10 seconds.'). The charm effect carries the base value 1, which the core reads as the highest level it may charm, so no player was ever charmed and the ghoul kept full control (#13937). Expected: the damage dealer who gets the potion is charmed and loses control while Krastinov keeps fighting the tank, and gets control back when the potion ends. The group setup follows the potion targeting scenario: tank, healer and damage dealer by specialization, grouped in Stormwind and teleported into one Scholomance instance.",
